* ..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+....8
TITLE
Paper 1 Benchmark FLUKA - BLANK @ 1000 keV, th=0.5 cm
*
DEFAULTS                                                              PRECISIO  
LOW-PWXS        -1.0                                                            
*
* Nguon photon 1000 keV (1.000000E-03 GeV) huong doc truc +z
* GOAT 2026-10-30: BEAM WHAT(3)=10000 mrad (>2000pi) -> nguon diem dang huong
BEAM      -1.000E-03              10000.                              PHOTON
BEAMPOS          0.0       0.0       0.0                                        
*
GEOBEGIN                                                              COMBNAME  
    0    0          Geometry for Paper 1 (MCNPX Benchmark equivalent)
SPH BLK        0.0 0.0 40.0 120.0
SPH WORLD      0.0 0.0 40.0 100.0
RCC COLLOUT    0.0 0.0 10.0 0.0 0.0 40.0 3.0
RCC COLLIN     0.0 0.0 10.0 0.0 0.0 40.0 0.5
RCC SAMPLE     0.0 0.0 50.0 0.0 0.0 0.5000 5.0
RCC DETECT     0.0 0.0 70.0 0.0 0.0 2.0 5.0
RCC SHIELDO    0.0 0.0 45.0 0.0 0.0 30.0 10.0
RCC SHIELDI    0.0 0.0 45.0 0.0 0.0 30.0 8.0
END
* Regions
BLKHOLE      5 +BLK -WORLD
COLLBODY     5 +COLLOUT -COLLIN
COLLBORE     5 +COLLIN
SAMPLE       5 +SAMPLE
DETECT       5 +DETECT
SHIELD       5 +SHIELDO -SHIELDI
CHAMBER      5 +SHIELDI -COLLOUT -SAMPLE -DETECT
AIRVOID      5 +WORLD -SHIELDO -COLLOUT
END
GEOEND
*
* Dinh nghia nguyen to vat lieu
MATERIAL           3  -6.94100   0.53400                              LITHIUM   
MATERIAL           5 -10.81100   2.34000                              BORON     
MATERIAL          20 -40.07800   1.55000                              CALCIUM   
MATERIAL          64-157.25000   7.90000                              GADOLINI  
*
*
* Gan vat lieu cho cac vung hinh hoc
ASSIGNMA    BLCKHOLE   BLKHOLE                                                  
ASSIGNMA        LEAD  COLLBODY                                                  
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM  COLLBORE                                                  
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM    SAMPLE                                                  
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM    DETECT                                                  
ASSIGNMA        LEAD    SHIELD                                                  
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM   CHAMBER                                                  
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM   AIRVOID                                                  
*
* Ha nguong van chuyen xuong 1 keV
EMFCUT    -1.000E-04 1.000E-06 1.000E-05    VACUUM  @LASTMAT          PROD-CUT  
EMFCUT    -1.000E-04 1.000E-06             BLKHOLE  @LASTREG                    
*
* Scoring: USRTRACK (F4 equivalent track-length fluence)
USRTRACK           1    PHOTON        21    DETECT 157.07960         1TotFlux   
USRTRACK   1.050E-03       0.0                                        &         
USRTRACK           1    PHOTON        22    DETECT 157.07960         1PeakFlux  
USRTRACK   1.010E-03 9.900E-04                                        &         
*
RANDOMIZ           1                                                            
START      @PRIMARIES@.                                                           
STOP                                                                            
